        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n\n    subgraph Client [\&quot;🎨 1. Frontend Layer - React SPA (/client)\&quot;]\n        direction TB\n        \n        AppManager[\&quot;&lt;code&gt;App.jsx&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Lifecycle &amp; View Orchestrator)&lt;/i&gt;\&quot;]:::clientLayer\n        \n        subgraph Views [\&quot;Field Notebook UI Components\&quot;]\n            NoteInput[\&quot;&lt;code&gt;NoteInput.jsx&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Lined Paper Area)&lt;/i&gt;\&quot;]:::clientLayer\n            Flashcards[\&quot;&lt;code&gt;FlashcardStack.jsx&lt;/code&gt; &amp; &lt;code&gt;Flashcard.jsx&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(3D rotateY Flip)&lt;/i&gt;\&quot;]:::clientLayer\n            Quiz[\&quot;&lt;code&gt;QuizRunner.jsx&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(SVG Checkboxes &amp; Re-Test Loop)&lt;/i&gt;\&quot;]:::clientLayer\n            Fallbacks[\&quot;&lt;code&gt;SkeletonLoader.jsx&lt;/code&gt; &amp; &lt;code&gt;ErrorState.jsx&lt;/code&gt;\&quot;]:::clientLayer\n        end\n\n        Hook[\&quot;Custom Network Hook&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;useAI.js&lt;/code&gt;\&quot;]:::clientLayer\n        AbortCtrl[\&quot;&lt;code&gt;AbortController&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Prevents Stale Updates)&lt;/i&gt;\&quot;]:::clientLayer\n        LocalStorage[\&quot;&lt;code&gt;localStorage&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Session &amp; Preference Persistence)&lt;/i&gt;\&quot;]:::storageLayer\n    end\n\n    subgraph Server [\&quot;🛡️ 2. Backend Proxy Layer (/server)\&quot;]\n        direction TB\n        \n        ExpressApp[\&quot;Express Server&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;POST /api/generate&lt;/code&gt;\&quot;]:::serverLayer\n        EnvVars[\&quot;Environment Variables&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;GROQ_API_KEY&lt;/code&gt;\&quot;]:::serverLayer\n        TimeoutGuard[\&quot;Timeout Manager&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;Promise.race&lt;/code&gt; (15s Cap)\&quot;]:::serverLayer\n        \n        subgraph HealingLoop [\&quot;🔁 Defensive Data &amp; Validation Pipeline\&quot;]\n            ZodCheck{\&quot;Zod Schema Validation&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;StudyPackageSchema.parse()&lt;/code&gt;\&quot;}:::serverLayer\n            RepairLogic[\&quot;Correction Call (Attempt 2)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Passes Zod Error Message to LLM)&lt;/i&gt;\&quot;]:::serverLayer\n            Fallback422[\&quot;Clean 422 HTTP Fallback&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Server Never Crashes)&lt;/i&gt;\&quot;]:::serverLayer\n        end\n    end\n\n    subgraph AI [\&quot;🤖 3. AI &amp; Data Layer\&quot;]\n        GroqSDK[\&quot;Groq API SDK&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;llama-3.3-70b-versatile&lt;/code&gt;\&quot;]:::aiLayer\n        JsonFormat[\&quot;Enforced Format&lt;br/&gt;&lt;code&gt;type: &#39;json_object&#39;&lt;/code&gt;\&quot;]:::aiLayer\n    end\n\n    NoteInput --&gt;|\&quot;User Submits Notes\&quot;| AppManager\n    AppManager --&gt; Hook\n    Hook --- AbortCtrl\n    Hook --&gt;|\&quot;1. POST /api/generate\&quot;| ExpressApp\n    ExpressApp --- EnvVars\n    ExpressApp --&gt; TimeoutGuard\n    \n    TimeoutGuard --&gt;|\&quot;2. Attempt 1 Request\&quot;| GroqSDK\n    GroqSDK --- JsonFormat\n    GroqSDK --&gt;|\&quot;3. Raw JSON Output\&quot;| ZodCheck\n\n    ZodCheck --&gt;|\&quot;✅ Valid Schema\&quot;| ExpressApp\n    ZodCheck --&gt;|\&quot;❌ Zod Error\&quot;| RepairLogic\n    RepairLogic --&gt;|\&quot;4. Attempt 2 Repair Call\&quot;| GroqSDK\n    RepairLogic --&gt;|\&quot;❌ Failed Repair\&quot;| Fallback422\n    Fallback422 --&gt;|\&quot;5. 422 Error Response\&quot;| Hook\n\n    ExpressApp --&gt;|\&quot;6. Validated Data Payload\&quot;| Hook\n    Hook --&gt;|\&quot;7. Hydrates State\&quot;| AppManager\n    AppManager --&gt; Flashcards\n    AppManager --&gt; Quiz\n    AppManager --&gt; Fallbacks\n    AppManager &lt;--&gt;|\&quot;Persist / Restore\&quot;| LocalStorage&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="zVkqRWOWy5_vNlZsA8NE-1">
